<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss June unemployment rate falls to 5.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Swiss June unemployment rate falls to 5.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's unemployment rate stood at 5.1 percent in June, down from May's 5.3 percent, the Federal Office of Trade, Industry and Labour said.</p>
<p>					 June 1997  May 1997  June 1996</p>
<p> Pct of workforce unemployed   5.1 pct    5.3 pct   4.4 pct</p>
<p> Number of jobless		 185,320    192,091   159,964</p>
<p> Job vacancies		     10,746     10,870    6,388</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
